; Filament-specific end gcode
G1 E-1 F2100 ; retract
G1 Z81.95 F720 ; Move print head up
G1 X178 Y178 F4200 ; park print head
G1 Z109.95 F720 ; Move print head further up
G4 ; wait
M104 S0 ; turn off temperature
M140 S0 ; turn off heatbed
M107 ; turn off fan
M221 S100 ; reset flow
M900 K0 ; reset LA
M84 ; disable motors
; max_layer_z = 79.95
M73 P100 R0
M73 Q100 S0
